      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic and welcoming clinical team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most clients commend Dr. Robison, Dr. Noble, and the nursing assistants for their warmth, compassion, and supportive bedside manner during difficult moments. Pet owners appreciate staff who take time to explain surgical procedures and listen attentively. However, a few reviewers reported frustrating encounters with office management over phone communications."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable rates alongside estimate disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers describe the clinic fees as refreshingly affordable, highlighting competitive pricing for routine spay surgeries, vaccinations, and examinations. In contrast, several clients expressed frustration over shifting surgery estimates and price increases between initial consultations and appointment dates, advising owners to confirm quotes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful surgeries and routine care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report smooth recoveries following routine spay and neuter procedures, mass removals, and emergency medical treatments. Reviewers note that clinical staff monitor animals carefully and provide thorough post-operative instructions for home recovery. While one reviewer questioned diagnostic advice, most express strong satisfaction with medical outcomes."
      }
    }
  ],
